# Parkiroid key points

## SMS (device-only)

- All outbound SMS goes through `SmsSender` (`SmsSender.send` / `sendToAll`). Requires runtime `SEND_SMS`. No server API.
- Accelerometer alarms optionally SMS comma-separated numbers from settings (`alertPhoneNumbers`).
- Use `SmsSender` for any new feature that needs to send SMS on the device.
